  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed flats by reasons of its inadequate internal size and private amenity space, would result in poor quality of accommodation for the future occupants, failing to comply with the objectives of the policy D6 of the London Plan (2021), policies 3.5 and 7D of the Ealing Development Management DPD (2013) and Housing Design Standards LPG (2023). | The proposed additional entrance door on the front elevation, by reasons of its design which would not match the existing fenestration pattern of the host building, would harm the design and appearance of the host building, failing to comply with the objectives of the policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), policies 7B and 7.4 of the Ealing Development Management DPD (2013), and SPD4."
  ],
